Subject: [PATCH 064/107] Unified: macros and developer tools in the Tools menu

The Macro menu moves into the Tools menu, and the tools for developers
(scene inspector, dependency graph, document utility, parameter editor)
into a submenu of it: one menu less in the menu bar and a shorter Tools
menu.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
